    "buggy_rtl_source": "module counter6bit_test(ENA,CLR,F_IN,Q);\n    input ENA;\n    input CLR;\n    input F_IN;\n    output [23:0] Q;  \n    \n    reg [23:0] Q;\n    reg [19:0] temp_bcd;\n    reg F_OUT;\n    \n\n\n\t\t\n\nalways @(posedge F_IN)\nbegin\nif(CLR==1) Q<=0;\nelse\nbegin\nif(ENA==1)\nbegin\nif(Q[3:0]==4'b1001) \nbegin\ntemp_bcd<=temp_bcd+1;\nQ<={temp_bcd,4'b0000};\nend\nelse if(Q[7:0]==8'b10000000)  Q<=0;\nelse Q=Q+1;\nend\nend\nend\nendmodule",
